---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CarouselTab from "../../components/CarouselTab.astro";
import ExpCard from "../../components/ExpCard.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Project AR" windowTitle="web project" showCloseBtn={true}>
  <div class="projectWindow">
    <div class="lg-8 lg-offset-2" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox jc">
        <h2>DBS Annual Report 2022</h2>
        <p>This year's project was a team effort, and I was responsible for creating a page with a mouse hover effect that displays details and directs users to a person's profile page when clicked. I took the initiative to improvise and incorporate this feature into the page to enhance the user experience.</p>
        <p>I believe that small details like micro-interactions and hover effects can make a big difference in the overall user experience.</p>
        <a href="https://www.dbs.com/annualreports/2022/index.html" target="_blank">
          <h5>Visit Website</h5>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <CarouselTab>
      <ExpCard type="video" src="https://tzejian3012.netlify.app/files/media/projects/ar-desktop-3.mp4" lg={6} />
      <ExpCard type="image" src="https://tzejian3012.netlify.app/files/media/small/ar-posb-desktop.png" hiResSrc="https://tzejian3012.netlify.app/files/media/projects/ar-posb-desktop.webp" lg={6} md={12} />
    </CarouselTab>
    <div class="lg-5" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox jc">
        <h2>DBS Annual Report 2021</h2>
        <p>I am working on this project again, which involves adapting the design provided by the client. In carrying
        out this task, I have been given a certain degree of creative freedom to implement and adapt details, including the
        integration of micro-interactions that I believe will enhance the overall user experience.</p>
        <p>I take pride in my ability to pay attention to details and create engaging designs that effectively communicate the
        client's message. With this in mind, I am confident that I can deliver a polished and user-friendly website that meets
        the client's needs and exceeds their expectations.</p>
        <a href="https://tinyurl.com/4fpaj4v4"  target="_blank"><h5>Visit Website</h5></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-7" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <video playsinline loop autoplay muted data-lazyVideo>
          <source src="/media/projects/ar-desktop-2.mp4" type='video/mp4' />
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-7" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img class="lazy" src="/media/small/ar-desktop.png" data-hiResImg="/media/projects/ar-desktop.webp" alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-5" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox jc">
        <h2>DBS Annual Report 2020</h2>
        <p>The COVID-19 pandemic presented a unique challenge when I was tasked with developing a website this year. As the sole
        developer working closely with my project manager, we ensured the site's quality by conducting thorough checks before sending the project to the client for review.</p>
        <p>This project was particularly special for me because it was the first time I had worked on it, and I appreciated the
        opportunity to showcase my skills. Despite the difficulties posed by the pandemic, we were able to deliver this project within the constricted timeframe.</p>
        <a href="https://tinyurl.com/2p9amd94" target="_blank"><h5>Visit Website</h5></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
